# Source/configuration allowlist. Media and unknown file types stay local.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!*.py
!*.js
!*.mjs
!*.cjs
!*.ts
!*.tsx
!*.jsx
!*.html
!*.css
!*.json
!*.md
!*.txt
!*.toml
!*.yaml
!*.yml
!*.ini
!*.cfg
!*.ps1
!*.bat
!*.cmd
!*.sh
!*.lock
!LICENSE
!LICENSE.*
!*-LICENSE
!NOTICE
!NOTICE.*

# Runtime, generated output, media, drafts, caches and local inputs.
**/node_modules/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/.cache/**
**/raster_cache/**
**/00_brief/input/**
**/04_assets/**
**/06_project/render/**
**/07_exports/**
**/08_qc/**
**/exports/**
**/checks/**
**/qc/**
!**/qc/*.py
**/card_media/**
**/card_text/**
**/card_manifests/**
**/catalog/**
**/package/**
**/local_font_ready/**
**/installation_audit/**
**/boundary_snapshot*.json
**/boundary_verification.json
**/text_difference_report.*
**/*.zip.receipt.json
**/narration.txt

# Credentials and machine-specific private configuration.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*credentials*.json
**/*credentials*.ini
**/*secrets*.json
**/*secrets*.yaml
**/*secrets*.yml
**/*.local.json
**/*.local.ini
**/*.local.cfg
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.netrc
**/.git-credentials
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Explicit safeguard even if future text extensions are allowed above.
**/*.srt
**/*.vtt
**/*.log
